# String building

Do **not** join strings with the `+` operator (exceptions, URLs, log messages, SQL fragments).

## 1. Prefer `.formatted()`

```java
// ❌
throw new NotFoundException("View not found with id=" + id);

// ✅
throw new NotFoundException("View not found with id=%s".formatted(id));
```

## 2. Otherwise `StringBuilder`

For loops or many conditional segments.

## Never

- `+` to build user-facing text, paths, or SQL/JPQL fragments.
- Interpolate user input into query strings — bind via parameters ([visita-jpa.mdc](visita-jpa.mdc)).
